    },
    "summary": "When a weapon picked during [Select Weapons](vsdata:core-rule/select-weapons) has several profiles, its controlling player also picks 1, which the [Resolve Attacks](vsdata:core-rule/resolve-attacks) step then uses. Each model of a unit with such weapons can pick a different profile.\n\nA Hunter profile can target only units with the keywords it names.",
